    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-morphometric-validation-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py L343–L365" ;
        dcterms:description "7-point AP profile Pearson r and RMSE validation against Mongera et al. (2018)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py#L343-L365> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Mongera et al. (2018) & Kim et al. (2021) zebrafish tailbud active fluid-to-solid jamming transition & yield-stress axis elongation — Morphometric validation: 89/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1734-1862) now returns 14 measurements with units and references: the 8 Pass 2 metrics (MPZ/A-PSM yield stress, 7-point sigma_y and k_T1 correlations, WT-cdh2 speed drop, cdh2 asymmetry, N = 391 nuclei, specimen compaction r = 0.9915) plus 6 Pass 3 metrics (fn1a;fn1b speed ratio 0.79 vs ~0.70, width ratio 1.24 vs ~1.20, arrest front 161 vs ~180 um, Cooke-Zeeman S 46.2 vs ~47 um, frozen stripe wavelength vs S, cdh2 peak jamming ratio vs the gate). Deductions: the Dray ratios, the 47 um somite length, the 180 um arrest front and the 0.45 um/min PSM shortening are approximate anchors flagged as such (reference JSON L288-333), not digitised figure values with uncertainties (-5); the stripe-wavelength-vs-S check is a numerical consistency test of the advection scheme (both derive from v_front), not a biological validation (-3); the itga5 regime misses its approximate ratio by 16% (0.95 vs 0.82) and this is only reported via the 3-regime RMSE (-3)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/neuromesodermal_jamming/neuromesodermal_jamming_reference.json L288–L333: Dray-2013 ratios and clock anchors are explicitly approximate (approximate_digitization: true, uncertainty_pct 25) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/neuromesodermal_jamming/neuromesodermal_jamming_reference.json#L288-L333>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-ap-t1-rearrangement-rate-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-ap-yield-stress-profile-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-cdh2-knockdown-lr-asymmetry-pct>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-cdh2-morphant-peak-jamming-ratio>,
